# Third-party Kokoro model weights, and the voice clones built from them.
#
# These are downloaded, not authored here -- VOICE.md's Setup section says
# where to get them. `voice/.gitignore` has had the right rules since the
# voice landed, but a .gitignore only governs its own directory, and the
# models live HERE, at the root, in `.kokoro/`. So the rules were correct
# and out of scope, which is worse than absent: it reads as handled.
#
# Measured 2026-09-03 before this file existed: `git add -A` would have
# staged 198.6 MB, including a 169 MB `kokoro-v1.0.fp16.onnx`. GitHub
# rejects a blob over 100 MB, so that commit would have succeeded locally
# and failed at the push, leaving the object in history to be surgically
# removed. Confirmed with `git check-ignore`, which reported WOULD COMMIT
# on every one of them.
.kokoro/

# The same weights wherever else they are fetched to, since the download
# location is the user's choice and only the default is `.kokoro/`.
kokoro-v1.0*.onnx
voices-v1.0.bin

# Rendered audio. `voice/astrid_voice.npy` -- the built voice embedding --
# is deliberately NOT ignored: it is authored here, it is small, and
# without it every clone has to rebuild her voice before she can speak.
*.wav
